.TH COLDSPOT 1 "2026-07-27" "coldspot 0.5.0" "coldspot manual"
.SH NAME
coldspot \- verb CLI for the coldspot metered-link daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B coldspot
.RI [ verb ]
.RI [ args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B coldspot
talks to
.BR coldspotd (8)
over its control socket and prints the answer. It never uses
.BR sudo :
every privileged action happens inside the daemon, gated by membership in
the
.B coldspot
system group.
.SH EVERYDAY VERBS
.TP
.B status
MB used, budget, stance, top talkers.
.TP
.BI budget " MB"
Cap this session's data use; the pill heats up as you near it.
.TP
.B siege
Only the active task talks on the wire; everything else is dropped.
.TP
.B run \-\- " cmd " ...
Launch a job as the active task, warmed into the priority lane.
.TP
.BI limit " rate"
Hard system-wide egress cap, e.g.
.IR 1mbps .
.TP
.BI uncap " app"
Warm a task: full speed even while everything else is cold.
.TP
.B open
Panic release: lift all throttling and siege.
.TP
.BI stance " open|lean|cold|siege"
Set the stance directly.
.SH LINK HEALTH
.TP
.B link
Per-interface board: signal, band/channel, PHY rate, loss, power-save,
health score.
.TP
.BI aim " [iface]"
Live signal meter for positioning an antenna.
.TP
.B stabilize " " auto
Shape a weak or lossy link so it stops collapsing under load.
.TP
.B steer " " auto
Make the healthiest radio primary.
.TP
.B bond
Aggregate independent uplinks into one pipe (ECMP), health-gated.
.SH NETWORK MEMORY
.TP
.B policy
List the remembered policy for every known network.
.TP
.B here " " <stance>
Set the policy for the network you're on right now.
.TP
.BI remember " ssid stance"
Set the policy for a named network.
.TP
.BI forget " ssid"
Drop a network's remembered policy; it re-seeds next time you're on it.
.SH ANALYSIS
.TP
.B top
Live per-app upload/download view.
.TP
.B history
Per-connection usage, today and this month.
.TP
.BI report " [today|week|month]"
Breakdown by connection and app.
.TP
.B ledger
What ate today's data; persists across BPF core reloads.
.TP
.B advise
Proactive nudges about apps behaving badly.
.SH UPDATING
.TP
.B update " [\-\-check]"
Pull a newer release now. Signature-verified; see
.BR coldspot-update (8).
.SH FILES
.I /etc/coldspot.conf
.RS
Daemon configuration.
.RE
.I /run/coldspot/status.json
.RS
The seam the CLI and the GNOME pill both read.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR coldspotd (8)
